# Keep LF in the repository and in checkouts on every OS: shell scripts break with CRLF and the
# Prettier/ruff checks expect LF. Windows batch files are the exception.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.db binary
